#: templates/core/about.html:3
msgid "About TravelPipa — Local Boutique Travel Agency in Pipa"
msgstr "Sobre TravelPipa — agencia boutique local en Pipa"

#: templates/core/about.html:4
msgid ""
"TravelPipa is a boutique travel agency in Praia da Pipa, Brazil, offering "
"selected tours, local experiences and transfers with personal assistance."
msgstr ""
"TravelPipa es una agencia de viajes boutique en Praia da Pipa, Brasil, con "
"tours seleccionados, experiencias locales y traslados con atención "
"personalizada."

#: templates/core/about.html:11 templates/includes/footer.html:29
#: templates/includes/header.html:11 templates/includes/header.html:47
msgid "About"
msgstr "Nosotros"

#: templates/core/about.html:13
msgid "About us"
msgstr "Quiénes somos"

#: templates/core/about.html:14
msgid "A boutique agency for travellers who want to experience Pipa well"
msgstr "Una agencia boutique para quienes quieren vivir Pipa de verdad"

#: templates/core/about.html:27
msgid ""
"TravelPipa helps visitors discover Praia da Pipa and the surrounding region "
"through a small selection of tours, local experiences and transfers."
msgstr ""
"TravelPipa ayuda a los visitantes a descubrir Praia da Pipa y sus "
"alrededores a través de una pequeña selección de tours, experiencias locales"
" y traslados."

#: templates/core/about.html:28
msgid ""
"Instead of offering everything, we focus on a few experiences we know well "
"and that we are comfortable recommending. Each one is presented with clear "
"information about what is included, what to bring and how cancellations "
"work."
msgstr ""
"En lugar de ofrecerlo todo, nos centramos en pocas experiencias que "
"conocemos bien y que recomendamos con tranquilidad. Cada una se presenta con"
" información clara sobre lo que incluye, qué llevar y cómo funcionan las "
"cancelaciones."

#: templates/core/about.html:29
msgid ""
"Before and during your trip, you talk to a person — in English, Portuguese "
"or Spanish — who helps you choose, adjusts plans to the weather and tides, "
"and keeps you informed."
msgstr ""
"Antes y durante tu viaje hablas con una persona —en español, inglés o "
"portugués— que te ayuda a elegir, adapta los planes al clima y las mareas y "
"te mantiene informado."

#: templates/core/about.html:35
msgid "Our commitment"
msgstr "Nuestro compromiso"

#: templates/core/about.html:37
msgid "Recommend only experiences we know and trust."
msgstr "Recomendar solo experiencias que conocemos y en las que confiamos."

#: templates/core/about.html:38
msgid "Give clear information before you book."
msgstr "Dar información clara antes de reservar."

#: templates/core/about.html:39
