#: templates/core/home.html:136
msgid ""
"Fewer options, chosen with care. We work with operators we know and only "
"list experiences we would recommend to friends."
msgstr ""
"Menos opciones, elegidas con cuidado. Trabajamos con operadores que "
"conocemos y solo ofrecemos experiencias que recomendaríamos a amigos."

#: templates/core/home.html:143
msgid "Clear booking information"
msgstr "Información de reserva clara"

#: templates/core/home.html:144
msgid ""
"What is included, what is not, meeting points and cancellation rules — "
"written clearly before you decide."
msgstr ""
"Qué incluye, qué no, puntos de encuentro y reglas de cancelación, todo claro"
" antes de que decidas."

#: templates/core/home.html:158
msgid "Low tide at sunset in Praia da Pipa"
msgstr "Marea baja al atardecer en Praia da Pipa"

