#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:5
msgid ""
"Boat tours, buggy adventures, beaches, nature and local experiences in Pipa,"
" Brazil — a short list of experiences selected by a local agency."
msgstr ""
"Paseos en barco, aventuras en buggy, playas, naturaleza y experiencias "
"locales en Pipa, Brasil: una lista corta seleccionada por una agencia local."

