msgstr "Qué hacer en Pipa"

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:16
msgid "Experiences in Pipa"
msgstr "Experiencias en Pipa"

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:17
msgid ""
"Boat trips, buggy rides along the dunes, beaches, nature and local life. "
"Choose an experience to see the details and book online."
msgstr ""
"Paseos en barco, buggy por las dunas, playas, naturaleza y vida local. Elige"
" una experiencia para ver los detalles y reservar online."

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:23
msgid "Filter by category"
msgstr "Filtrar por categoría"

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:24
msgid "All"
msgstr "Todas"

