#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:42
msgid "Ask us for a suggestion"
msgstr "Pídenos una sugerencia"

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:52
msgid ""
"Looking for something that is not listed — a private tour, a special "
"occasion or a multi-day plan?"
msgstr ""
"¿Buscas algo que no está en la lista: un tour privado, una ocasión especial "
"o un plan de varios días?"

#: templates/tours/experience_list.html:52
msgid "Tell us what you have in mind."
msgstr "Cuéntanos qué tienes en mente."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:4
msgid "Natal Airport Transfer to Pipa"
msgstr "Traslado del aeropuerto de Natal a Pipa"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:5
msgid ""
"Transfers from Natal Airport to Pipa and to Ponta Negra (Natal), priced per "
"car. We negotiate a discount for round trips. Book online with a local "
"agency."
msgstr ""
"Traslados del Aeropuerto de Natal a Pipa y a Ponta Negra (Natal), con precio"
" por coche. Negociamos un descuento si cierras ida y vuelta. Reserva online "
"con una agencia local."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:15
msgid "Getting to Pipa, made simple"
msgstr "Llegar a Pipa, de forma sencilla"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:16
msgid ""
"Natal International Airport (NAT) is the usual arrival point for Pipa. Book "
"one way or round trip — we negotiate a discount for round trips."
msgstr ""
"El Aeropuerto Internacional de Natal (NAT) es la llegada más habitual para "
"ir a Pipa. Reserva solo ida o ida y vuelta: si cierras ida y vuelta, "
"negociamos un descuento."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:29
msgid "Main route"
msgstr "Ruta principal"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:29 templates/tours/transfers.html:68
msgid "We negotiate a discount for round trips"
msgstr "Negociamos descuento en ida y vuelta"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:45
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detalles"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:53
msgid "Other transfers"
msgstr "Otros traslados"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:72
msgid "Book"
msgstr "Reservar"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:82
msgid ""
"Transfer options will be published soon. Meanwhile, ask us for a quote."
msgstr ""
"Las opciones de traslado se publicarán pronto. Mientras tanto, pídenos un "
"presupuesto."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:92
msgid "Send your flight"
msgstr "Envía tu vuelo"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:92
msgid ""
"Share your flight number and arrival time when you book so the pickup can be"
" planned around it."
msgstr ""
"Indica el número de vuelo y la hora de llegada al reservar para organizar la"
" recogida."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:93
msgid "Meet your driver"
msgstr "Encuentra a tu conductor"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:93
msgid "After you book, you receive the meeting point and pickup details."
msgstr ""
"Después de reservar, recibes el punto de encuentro y los detalles de la "
"recogida."

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:94
msgid "Arrive relaxed"
msgstr "Llega tranquilo"

#: templates/tours/transfers.html:94
msgid ""
"Go straight to your accommodation in Pipa, with assistance in your language."
msgstr "Ve directo a tu alojamiento en Pipa, con atención en tu idioma."

